p Hi #{USERNAME},
p The transfer of your account to #{BENEFICIARY} has started.
if WINDOW_END
  p An invitation to accept it was sent to #{BENEFICIARY}, who has until #{WINDOW_END} to do so.
else
  p An invitation to accept it was sent to #{BENEFICIARY}.
if FALLBACK_DELETE
  p If #{BENEFICIARY} does not accept it in time, your account and all its data will be deleted, and this cannot be undone.
else if FALLBACK_KEEP
  p If #{BENEFICIARY} does not accept it in time, your account stays as it is.
if ACCOUNT_APP_URL
  p
    | If you still use this account and want to keep it, you can cancel the transfer on your account page:
    |
    a(href=ACCOUNT_APP_URL target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{ACCOUNT_APP_URL}
else
  p If you still use this account and want to keep it, you can cancel the transfer on your account page.
if EXPORT_URL
  p
    | To keep a copy of your data, download it:
    |
    a(href=EXPORT_URL target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{EXPORT_URL}
p If you did not set this, sign in, change your password right away and contact the support of your platform.
